          "content_chars": 3,
          "text": "‘人活位，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 20,
          "verse": 6,
          "content_chars": 3,
          "text": "6 说名了："
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 22,
          "verse": 6,
          "content_chars": 10,
          "text": "因为这一切件赐给了我，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 36,
          "verse": 9,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "就从这里跳下去吧。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 38,
          "verse": 10,
          "content_chars": 12,
          "text": "‘他过要为名你吩咐他的使者，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 45,
          "verse": 12,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "记了说“经上又："
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 53,
          "verse": 14,
          "content_chars": 12,
          "text": "消息传遍关于他的了整乡村。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 57,
          "verse": 16,
          "content_chars": 18,
          "text": "16 他来过些到 __VILLAGE_A__ ，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 58,
          "verse": 16,
          "content_chars": 10,
          "text": "那里了是地方他长大的。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 59,
          "verse": 16,
          "content_chars": 5,
          "text": "日到过安息，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 63,
          "verse": 17,
          "content_chars": 5,
          "text": "他件展着开，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 77,
          "verse": 20,
          "content_chars": 16,
          "text": "的众人都会些堂里目不转睛地看着他。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 81,
          "verse": 22,
          "content_chars": 7,
          "text": "22 赞他着众人都称，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 96,
          "verse": 24,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "往群往不得尊着敬。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 98,
          "verse": 25,
          "content_chars": 19,
          "text": "在 __PROPHET_A__ 的时候了些，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 102,
          "verse": 26,
          "content_chars": 26,
          "text": "26 但 __PROPHET_A__ 并没有被那里了去差到他们，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 104,
          "verse": 27,
          "content_chars": 10,
          "text": "27 在以利沙先知的时候着，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 109,
          "verse": 28,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "28 话着听见这些，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 124,
          "verse": 33,
          "content_chars": 4,
          "text": "33 在会堂里，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 131,
          "verse": 34,
          "content_chars": 22,
          "text": "你了是 __MOST_HIGH_A__ 的圣名者！"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 135,
          "verse": 35,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "从了他身上出来个！"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 150,
          "verse": 38,
          "content_chars": 20,
          "text": "他们请 __PERSON_F__ 帮助名她过。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 158,
          "verse": 41,
          "content_chars": 7,
          "text": "41 鬼附过许多人被，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 162,
          "verse": 41,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "不允过许鬼群说话，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 163,
          "verse": 41,
          "content_chars": 12,
          "text": "因为他们弥赛亚知道件他是。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 167,
          "verse": 42,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "他人们着寻找，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 170,
          "verse": 43,
          "content_chars": 7,
          "text": "43 他些了对他们说："
        }
